{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-tracing","title":"知识追踪模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-analytics/methods/knowledge-tracing","wordCount":1684,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识追踪模型\">知识追踪模型</h1><p>问一个极其具体的问题：此时此刻，编号 8821 的学生掌握「递归」这个知识点的概率是多少？参与指标答不了——它只知道这人活跃；正确率也答不了——它把所有题混在一起。要回答这个问题，需要一类专门对「认知状态随作答序列演化」建模的方法，这就是知识追踪（Knowledge Tracing, KT）。它是全 hub 数学最密、也最能体现学习分析「精细推断」野心的一篇，更是 <a href=\"../applications/adaptive-personalization\">自适应与个性化</a> 的引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把作答序列翻译成知识状态序列\">核心概念：把作答序列翻译成知识状态序列</h2><p>知识追踪的输入是一串「（题目, 对/错）」的交互序列，输出是每个时刻、每个知识点的掌握概率。它要解决一个观测与隐变量的经典问题：我们只看得到「答对答错」（观测），真正想知道的是「会不会」（隐藏的知识状态）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[作答序列&lt;br/&gt;题目+对错] --&gt; B[知识追踪模型]&#10;  B --&gt; C[隐藏知识状态&lt;br/&gt;每个知识点掌握概率]&#10;  C --&gt; D[预测下一题对错]&#10;  C --&gt; E[驱动自适应选题]&#10;  D --&gt; F[模型评估 AUC]&#10;  E --&gt; G[个性化路径]\">flowchart TD\n  A[作答序列&lt;br/&gt;题目+对错] --&gt; B[知识追踪模型]\n  B --&gt; C[隐藏知识状态&lt;br/&gt;每个知识点掌握概率]\n  C --&gt; D[预测下一题对错]\n  C --&gt; E[驱动自适应选题]\n  D --&gt; F[模型评估 AUC]\n  E --&gt; G[个性化路径]</pre><p>三大流派沿一条清晰的复杂度阶梯展开：贝叶斯知识追踪（BKT）用隐马尔可夫、可解释；深度知识追踪（DKT）用循环网络、更准但是黑箱；注意力知识追踪（AKT/SAKT）用 Transformer，兼顾长程依赖与一定可解释性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bkt-可解释的隐马尔可夫起点\">BKT：可解释的隐马尔可夫起点</h2><p>贝叶斯知识追踪由 Corbett 与 Anderson 于 1995 年提出，至今仍是工业界的稳健基线。它为每个知识点维护一个二值隐状态——「已掌握」或「未掌握」，用四个参数刻画其动力学：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(L_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>初始掌握概率</td>\n<td>一开始就会的可能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>学会转移概率</td>\n<td>做一题后从不会变会</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(G)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>猜对概率（guess）</td>\n<td>不会也蒙对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>失误概率（slip）</td>\n<td>会了却答错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每次作答后，用贝叶斯法则更新掌握后验。设作答前掌握概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(L_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，若学生答对，则后验为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>对</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(L_t \\mid \\text{对}) = \\frac{P(L_t)\\,(1-P(S))}{P(L_t)\\,(1-P(S)) + (1-P(L_t))\\,P(G)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>再叠加学习转移得到下一步先验：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>obs</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>obs</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(L_{t+1}) = P(L_t \\mid \\text{obs}) + (1 - P(L_t \\mid \\text{obs}))\\,P(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">obs</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">obs</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。BKT 的最大优点是<strong>每个参数都有教学含义</strong>——猜对率、失误率能直接和教师对话。它的局限也清楚：每个知识点独立建模，捕捉不到知识点之间的依赖（学了循环有助于学递归这种迁移它看不见），且需要人工把题目映射到知识点（Q 矩阵），这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/educational-data-sources\">教育数据来源</a> 里强调的内容数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dkt-循环网络带来的精度跃升\">DKT：循环网络带来的精度跃升</h2><p>2015 年 Piech 等人提出深度知识追踪，把循环神经网络（尤其是 LSTM）引入这个领域，掀起了至今未息的深度学习浪潮。DKT 不再为每个知识点维护独立的二值状态，而是用一个高维隐向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{h}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 统一表示「学生此刻的整体知识状态」，并随作答序列演化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>LSTM</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{h}_t = \\text{LSTM}(\\mathbf{x}_t, \\mathbf{h}_{t-1}), \\qquad \\mathbf{y}_t = \\sigma(\\mathbf{W}\\mathbf{h}_t + \\mathbf{b})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LSTM</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{x}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 编码第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 次作答（题目与对错），输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{y}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 给出对所有知识点下一题答对的概率。相比 BKT，DKT 有两个本质优势：它能自动从数据里学到知识点间的依赖关系，无需人工 Q 矩阵；预测精度通常显著更高。代价是它成了黑箱——隐向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{h}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的某一维到底代表什么，无法直接解读，这给需要向师生解释的教育场景带来真实困扰，也是 <a href=\"../practice/la-ethics-privacy\">学习分析的伦理与隐私</a> 关心的可解释性问题。DKT 还有著名的「重构一致性」缺陷：答对一题后，模型对该知识点的掌握预测有时反而下降，违反直觉，后续工作（如加正则项）专门修补这一点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注意力流派与-2025-年的进展\">注意力流派与 2025 年的进展</h2><p>DKT 之后，知识追踪沿着深度学习继续演化。基于自注意力的 SAKT、考虑题目与作答距离的 AKT（Attentive KT）用 Transformer 架构替代 RNN，更好地建模长程依赖——一道很久以前做过的题，可能恰恰对当前最相关，注意力机制能直接「跨越时间」抓住它。截至 2025 年，主流深度知识追踪模型已分化出 RNN 系、注意力系、图神经网络系（用知识点图结构）、乃至引入大语言模型的新尝试；开源工具包 pyKT 把这些模型统一到可复现的基准上，缓解了早期论文「各报各的数」的乱象。一个值得关注的方向是「遗忘建模」——把人的遗忘曲线显式编码进注意力（如解耦遗忘模式与题目相关性），让模型对长序列里的知识衰减更敏感。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[BKT 1995&lt;br/&gt;隐马尔可夫·可解释] --&gt; B[DKT 2015&lt;br/&gt;LSTM·更准·黑箱]&#10;  B --&gt; C[SAKT/AKT&lt;br/&gt;注意力·长程依赖]&#10;  C --&gt; D[GNN-KT&lt;br/&gt;知识点图结构]&#10;  C --&gt; E[LLM-KT&lt;br/&gt;语义增强]&#10;  B --&gt; F[遗忘建模&lt;br/&gt;衰减感知]\">flowchart TD\n  A[BKT 1995&lt;br/&gt;隐马尔可夫·可解释] --&gt; B[DKT 2015&lt;br/&gt;LSTM·更准·黑箱]\n  B --&gt; C[SAKT/AKT&lt;br/&gt;注意力·长程依赖]\n  C --&gt; D[GNN-KT&lt;br/&gt;知识点图结构]\n  C --&gt; E[LLM-KT&lt;br/&gt;语义增强]\n  B --&gt; F[遗忘建模&lt;br/&gt;衰减感知]</pre><h2 id=\"怎么选-精度-可解释-数据量的三角权衡\">怎么选：精度、可解释、数据量的三角权衡</h2><p>没有放之四海皆准的最佳模型，选型是三个维度的权衡。<strong>数据量小、知识点清晰、需要向教师解释</strong>——选 BKT，参数即教学语言，小样本也稳。<strong>数据量大、追求预测精度、可接受黑箱</strong>——选 DKT 或注意力模型。<strong>序列很长、存在明显遗忘与跨题依赖</strong>——注意力系更合适。评估几乎统一用 AUC（曲线下面积）衡量「预测下一题对错」的能力，但要警惕一个陷阱：AUC 高不等于对教学有用——一个靠「这人最近老答对」走捷径的模型 AUC 也可能不低，却没真正建模知识，这正是 <a href=\"../practice/validity-pitfalls\">有效性与陷阱</a> 反复敲打的代理变量问题。可解释性、对干预的响应、对冷启动学生的表现，都是 AUC 之外必须一并考量的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>知识追踪对「某学生此刻掌握某知识点的概率」建模，是从可观测的作答推断不可观测的认知状态。</li>\n<li>BKT（1995）用四参数隐马尔可夫，可解释、小样本稳，但知识点独立且需人工 Q 矩阵。</li>\n<li>DKT（2015）用 LSTM 自动学知识点依赖、精度更高，代价是黑箱与重构一致性缺陷。</li>\n<li>注意力与图神经网络流派进一步建模长程依赖与知识结构，pyKT 等工具统一了基准；选型是精度、可解释、数据量的三角权衡，且 AUC 高不等于教学有用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>知识追踪驱动的应用：<a href=\"../applications/adaptive-personalization\">自适应与个性化</a></li>\n<li>它是序列挖掘的概率化精炼：<a href=\"educational-data-mining\">教育数据挖掘</a></li>\n<li>模型可信度的批判性回看：<a href=\"../practice/validity-pitfalls\">有效性与陷阱</a></li>\n<li>跨库：知识追踪是 AI 个性化学习的核心引擎，参见数字学习工具 hub 的 <a href=\"../../digital-learning-tools/ai-assisted/personalized-learning\">个性化学习</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"知识追踪模型","id":"知识追踪模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把作答序列翻译成知识状态序列","id":"核心概念-把作答序列翻译成知识状态序列"},{"level":2,"text":"BKT：可解释的隐马尔可夫起点","id":"bkt-可解释的隐马尔可夫起点"},{"level":2,"text":"DKT：循环网络带来的精度跃升","id":"dkt-循环网络带来的精度跃升"},{"level":2,"text":"注意力流派与 2025 年的进展","id":"注意力流派与-2025-年的进展"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么选：精度、可解释、数据量的三角权衡","id":"怎么选-精度-可解释-数据量的三角权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"教育数据挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-analytics/methods/educational-data-mining"},"next":{"title":"风险预警与辍学预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-analytics/applications/early-warning-dropout"}}